---
import Base from "../../../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="博客 — 丝网采购指南、选型技巧与产业洞察"
  description="面向丝网买家的实用指南：材质选择、规格对照、工厂 sourcing、验厂清单与贸易技巧。中文买家专属内容。"
  lang="zh"
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-8">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">MeshCalculator 博客</h1>
    <p class="text-theme-secondary text-lg mb-8">
      面向海外采购的丝网实用指南。不讲空话——只讲规格、标准与采购情报。
    </p>

    <div class="space-y-6">
      <!-- 河北产业集群 -->
      <article class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-6 hover:border-theme-primary transition">
        <div class="text-sm text-theme-secondary mb-2">2026年9月 • 产业带深度</div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-2">
          <a href="/zh/blog/hebei-wire-mesh-cluster-guide/" class="hover:underline">
            走进河北丝网产业集群：2万家工厂如何竞争——以及这对买家意味着什么
          </a>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
          河北丝网产业集群详解：安平2万家工厂、乡镇产品分工地图、内卷式竞争带来的风险，以及降低采购成本的多报价策略。
        </p>
        <div class="flex gap-2 text-xs">
          <span class="bg-theme-secondary bg-opacity-20 text-theme-secondary px-2 py-1 rounded">河北产业带</span>
          <span class="bg-theme-secondary bg-opacity-20 text-theme-secondary px-2 py-1 rounded">安平</span>
          <span class="bg-theme-secondary bg-opacity-20 text-theme-secondary px-2 py-1 rounded">工厂 sourcing</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- 进口指南 -->
      <article class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-6 hover:border-theme-primary transition">
        <div class="text-sm text-theme-secondary mb-2">2026年9月 • 进口实操</div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-2">
          <a href="/zh/blog/how-to-import-wire-mesh-from-china/" class="hover:underline">
            如何从中国进口丝网：分步指南（2026）
          </a>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
          了解从中国进口丝网的 7 个步骤：明确规格、在安平寻找工厂、验证供应商、订购样品、谈判贸易术语、安全付款和安排运输。包含质检清单和防骗提示。
        </p>
        <div class="flex gap-2 text-xs">
          <span class="bg-theme-secondary bg-opacity-20 text-theme-secondary px-2 py-1 rounded">进口</span>
          <span class="bg-theme-secondary bg-opacity-20 text-theme-secondary px-2 py-1 rounded">贸易条款</span>
          <span class="bg-theme-secondary bg-opacity-20 text-theme-secondary px-2 py-1 rounded">付款安全</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- 过滤选型 -->
      <article class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-6 hover:border-theme-primary transition">
        <div class="text-sm text-theme-secondary mb-2">2026年9月 • 选型指南</div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-2">
          <a href="/zh/blog/how-to-choose-wire-mesh-for-filtration/" class="hover:underline">
            如何为工业过滤选择丝网——完整买家指南
          </a>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
          了解如何选择合适的过滤丝网：材质、目数、微米精度、编织方式和标准。包含规格表和工厂采购技巧。
        </p>
        <div class="flex gap-2 text-xs">
          <span class="bg-theme-secondary bg-opacity-20 text-theme-secondary px-2 py-1 rounded">过滤</span>
          <span class="bg-theme-secondary bg-opacity-20 text-theme-secondary px-2 py-1 rounded">不锈钢</span>
          <span class="bg-theme-secondary bg-opacity-20 text-theme-secondary px-2 py-1 rounded">规格表</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- 尺寸对照 -->
      <article class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-6 hover:border-theme-primary transition">
        <div class="text-sm text-theme-secondary mb-2">2026年9月 • 规格基础</div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-2">
          <a href="/zh/blog/wire-mesh-size-chart-explained/" class="hover:underline">
            丝网尺寸对照表详解——目数 vs 微米 vs 丝规
          </a>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
          理解丝网尺寸体系：目数、微米精度、丝径和丝规。包含完整换算表和工业买家实用选型指南。
        </p>
        <div class="flex gap-2 text-xs">
          <span class="bg-theme-secondary bg-opacity-20 text-theme-secondary px-2 py-1 rounded">规格</span>
          <span class="bg-theme-secondary bg-opacity-20 text-theme-secondary px-2 py-1 rounded">换算表</span>
          <span class="bg-theme-secondary bg-opacity-20 text-theme-secondary px-2 py-1 rounded">工具</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- 钢板网 vs 冲孔板 -->
      <article class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-6 hover:border-theme-primary transition">
        <div class="text-sm text-theme-secondary mb-2">2026年9月 • 产品对比</div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-2">
          <a href="/zh/blog/expanded-metal-vs-perforated-metal/" class="hover:underline">
            钢板网与冲孔板：您的应用该选哪一种
          </a>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
          钢板网（扩张网）与冲孔板的结构差异、成本对比、典型应用场景，以及如何根据载荷、开孔率和防腐要求做选择。
        </p>
        <div class="flex gap-2 text-xs">
          <span class="bg-theme-secondary bg-opacity-20 text-theme-secondary px-2 py-1 rounded">钢板网</span>
          <span class="bg-theme-secondary bg-opacity-20 text-theme-secondary px-2 py-1 rounded">冲孔板</span>
          <span class="bg-theme-secondary bg-opacity-20 text-theme-secondary px-2 py-1 rounded">选型对比</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- 石笼网 -->
      <article class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-6 hover:border-theme-primary transition">
        <div class="text-sm text-theme-secondary mb-2">2026年9月 • 产品指南</div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-2">
          <a href="/zh/blog/gabion-baskets-buying-guide/" class="hover:underline">
            石笼网箱采购指南：规格、价格区间与安装要点
          </a>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
          石笼网箱的网孔规格、丝径选择、镀锌 vs Galfan  vs PVC 涂层对比、常见价格区间，以及水利工程与挡土墙项目的安装要点。
        </p>
        <div class="flex gap-2 text-xs">
          <span class="bg-theme-secondary bg-opacity-20 text-theme-secondary px-2 py-1 rounded">石笼网</span>
          <span class="bg-theme-secondary bg-opacity-20 text-theme-secondary px-2 py-1 rounded">水利工程</span>
          <span class="bg-theme-secondary bg-opacity-20 text-theme-secondary px-2 py-1 rounded">防腐</span>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
